====================================================================================================
S1 -- FORWARD MAP gamma_v(a0): how an observed gamma would map to an a0 amplitude
====================================================================================================
  Physics: the WB deep asymptote is set by the EXTERNAL field ratio y_extN = g_extN/a0.
  g_ext is FIXED BY THE GALAXY (measured), so a0 enters ONLY through that ratio --
  this is the amplitude handle, and it is the ONLY one (S3 shows the shape adds none).

