     9.360e-11   1.4643    1.1015    1.1390 |            1.7757  1.0854  1.1182  <- canonical
     1.000e-10   1.3470    1.1093    1.1489 |            1.6373  1.0919  1.1266
     1.130e-10   1.1510    1.1254    1.1692 |            1.4057  1.1053  1.1438  <- ALT
     1.200e-10   1.0638    1.1342    1.1802 |            1.3024  1.1126  1.1531  <- Milgrom
     1.350e-10   0.9088    1.1533    1.2039 |            1.1184  1.1285  1.1731
