      constrain the a-prior.  Carried as (0.01, 0.02, 0.035) in gamma = **ASSUMED BAND** anchored on
      that committed result (the frozen pipeline's Kepler forward model fixes ONE prior).
        0.010 in gamma -> a0   8.8%
        0.020 in gamma -> a0  17.7%
        0.035 in gamma -> a0  30.9%

  (e) g_ext CALIBRATION -- a term with NO amplification, and that is the point:
      a0 and g_ext enter ONLY as the ratio y_obs = g_ext/a0, so d ln a0 = d ln g_ext
